    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=633989490255331927&sectionId=633989490322440791)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggv-JNGybYe_text","label":"ggv-JNGybYe_text","default":"<strong>Made With Heart: The Human Touch Behind Every Memobrick</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggdYG6c1VNW_text","label":"ggdYG6c1VNW_text","default":"<p>\"Technology starts the process. Human care makes the difference. &nbsp;-Memobrick\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjjpgEfbjx_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggjjpgEfbjx_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/e382195d-1053-4e53-8f76-024f887bc4d6.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqHsrcAgeY_text","label":"ggqHsrcAgeY_text","default":"<p>A personalized gift should feel personal.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>When you choose a photograph that means something to you, you are not simply choosing an image. You are choosing a memory. Maybe it is a picture of your family, your child, your partner, your pet, your favorite car, or a moment you never want to forget.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is why we believe creating a Memobrick should involve more than simply putting a photo through an automated process.</p><p><strong>Every Memobrick is made with care, attention, and a human touch.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Technology can help us along the way, but people are behind the final result, making sure your memory is treated with the care it deserves.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2fQ1ySB9x_text","label":"gg2fQ1ySB9x_text","default":"<p>Every photograph tells a different story.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A family photograph may contain several faces. A child's drawing may have unusual shapes and colors. A motorcycle may have dozens of small details. A pet photograph may capture a funny expression that makes the entire picture special.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>These details are what make your photograph yours.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is why we do not want your Memobrick to feel like something that was simply generated and sent away.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We want it to feel like someone actually cared about the photograph you chose.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggtTuws90P8_text","label":"ggtTuws90P8_text","default":"Technology Is a Tool, Not the Heart of the Process"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUeeY4gOgq_text","label":"ggUeeY4gOgq_text","default":"<p>Modern technology gives us helpful tools that can make parts of the creative process more efficient.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>AI can assist with generating or processing images, but it is not the final decision maker.</p><p>The technology helps us get started.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>People make sure the result is right.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>When an image contains an unexpected detail, an unusual face, an awkward shape, or another mistake, it can be reviewed and manually corrected before the final Memobrick is prepared.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSmsmUipwu_label","label":"ggSmsmUipwu_label","default":"Add to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSmsmUipwu_outOfStockLabel","label":"ggSmsmUipwu_outOfStockLabel","default":"Out Of Stock"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSmsmUipwu_unavailableLabel","label":"ggSmsmUipwu_unavailableLabel","default":"Unavailable"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSmsmUipwu_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","label":"ggSmsmUipwu_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","default":"Please select a variant to add product to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSmsmUipwu_successMessage","label":"ggSmsmUipwu_successMessage","default":"Add product to cart successfully"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSmsmUipwu_errorMessage","label":"ggSmsmUipwu_errorMessage","default":"Cannot add product to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggfUIm-15i5_text","label":"ggfUIm-15i5_text","default":"We Look at the Details"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjCSfQFQNW_text","label":"ggjCSfQFQNW_text","default":"<p>The smallest details can make a big difference.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A face should look recognizable.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A vehicle should retain its important features.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A child's drawing should still feel like the artwork they created.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A family photograph should preserve the people and moments that make it meaningful.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>These are not details we want to overlook.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is why reviewing and refining the image is an important part of creating a Memobrick.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-pLQ3TSXn_text","label":"gg-pLQ3TSXn_text","default":"<p>When you order a personalized product, you are trusting someone with a memory that matters to you.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We understand that.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is why Memobrick is not about simply producing as many images as possible. It is about taking your photograph and turning it into something you will actually want to build and display.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg7xNfGfOBQ_text","label":"gg7xNfGfOBQ_text","default":"Every Photo Comes With Its Own Challenges"},{"type":"html","id":"gglcF3tKKfl_text","label":"gglcF3tKKfl_text","default":"<p>No two photographs are exactly the same.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Some are beautifully clear.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Some are older photographs.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Some contain multiple people.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Some have complicated backgrounds.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Some feature cars or motorcycles with lots of small details.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Some are children's drawings that were photographed from a sheet of paper.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That variety is part of what makes personalized products exciting.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It also means that every image deserves individual attention.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggslTlFRzH7_text","label":"ggslTlFRzH7_text","default":"From Your Photo to a Memory You Can Build"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2vbF9UfWB_text","label":"gg2vbF9UfWB_text","default":"<p>The process starts with <strong>your photograph</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That photograph is then prepared for the Memobrick format.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Technology can assist with parts of the image preparation, but the process does not stop there.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The result is reviewed, mistakes can be corrected, and adjustments can be made when needed.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Only then does the image become ready to transform into your brick mosaic.</p><p>So the journey is not simply:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Photo → Machine → Product</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It is more like:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Your Memory → Technology → Human Review → Careful Refinement → Memobrick</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That human step is what helps make the final result feel personal.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggT2SvgasBo_text","label":"ggT2SvgasBo_text","default":"Why Handmade Still Matters"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwTtmxrNdj_text","label":"ggwTtmxrNdj_text","default":"<p>We live in a world where many things can be produced instantly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But personalization is different.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>When something represents a meaningful memory, speed is not always the most important thing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Care is.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Attention is.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Getting the details right is.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A handmade approach means that the final product is connected to the people who created it, not just the technology used to produce it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is the difference between simply receiving a product and receiving something that feels like it was made <strong>for you</strong>.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gggXgK4yCGQ_text","label":"gggXgK4yCGQ_text","default":"A Memobrick Is More Than Bricks"},{"type":"html","id":"ggx13AdfY3c_text","label":"ggx13AdfY3c_text","default":"<p>When you look at a finished Memobrick, you see hundreds of individual pieces coming together to recreate an image.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But behind those pieces is something much more important.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Your story.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The photograph you selected.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The people in it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The place where it happened.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The reason you decided to preserve it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The time spent building it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And eventually, the place where you display it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is why we believe a Memobrick should be made with heart.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg_LBhH4uq1_text","label":"gg_LBhH4uq1_text","default":"Built by You, Made With Care by Us"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjoFHwdt2C_text","label":"ggjoFHwdt2C_text","default":"<p>There is something special about a product that involves both sides.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We carefully prepare the image and create the pieces.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Then you get to build the memory yourself.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Piece by piece, you watch the photograph come together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That means the final Memobrick has a human touch from beginning to end.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>We help create it. You bring it to life.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Whether it is a photograph of your family, your child, your partner, your pet, your favorite vehicle, or a moment from an unforgettable trip, the image you choose has meaning.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We want that meaning to carry through to the finished Memobrick.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is why we believe personalized products should never feel completely impersonal.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Your memory deserves attention.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Your photograph deserves care.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And your finished Memobrick deserves to be something you are proud to display.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggi1OAD9YF4_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggi1OAD9YF4_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/reviesa.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZrAXSNnXB_text","label":"ggZrAXSNnXB_text","default":"<p>Technology can make creating personalized products easier, but technology alone is not what makes a memory meaningful.</p><p><strong>People do.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The memories behind your photographs are personal, and we believe the products created from those memories should receive the same personal attention.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>At Memobrick, technology can help us along the way, but <strong>heart, craftsmanship, and human attention remain at the center of what we create.</strong></p><p>Because when you give us a memory, we know it is more than just a photo.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>It is something worth caring about.</strong></p>"}],
